quests-issues-and-comments/\" rel=\"nofollow\">reaction</a> to <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pulls?q=is%3Aopen+sort%3Areactions-%2B1-desc\">pull requests you find important</a>.</p>",
